s, operations-runbook and CURRENT receipt results\/reviews\/issue-2\/acceptance.json. Remove contradictory 'current' claims for old guide\/calibration\/old acceptance throughout root. Label legacy MySQL guides and benchmark acceptance historical\/frozen, retain optional lab commands but do not imply lab-only proof accepts newdocs. Ensure <=2click reachability from GitHubroot to all current guides\/runbook\/receipt. Other 4docs use Issue2 receipt and pre-fix Issue2 snapshot for historical Issue1 receipt; do not rewrite previous evidence files or old accepted source README.\n2 Separate MySQL replica DATA EQUIVALENCE gate from FRESHNESS gate and resource gate. Require owner record of source\/channel->schema\/table\/generation mapping incl name rewrites\/multi-source if applicable, current AND historical source\/binlog and channel\/global replication filters, complete initial copy provenance and all subsequent re-seeding\/rebuilds\/DDL, skip\/emptyGTID\/manualrepair\/localwrite histories using existing approved consistency audit\/change records. Need applicable bounds\/tablegen and timestamp. Current flags\/lag\/GTID cannot prove lineage: filtered transactions on replica persist GTID (official https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/replication-gtids-lifecycle.html). read_only\/super_read_only cannot prove no historical local writes. No automatic prod COUNT\/checksum\/ANALYZE\/repair\/filter changes to prove integrity. If equivalence unknown, result is precisely count of THIS COPY only; original service table exact request UNKNOWN\/HOLD, even if lag0\/freshness good. If equivalence qualified, still record allowed snapshotpoint\/freshness separately, never claim original primarycurrent exact just from GTID. Add fillable lineage audit fields + update filled examples to explicitly fictional lineage qualification for independentrestore vs hold\/unknown replica. Do not fabricate labfilter\/drift test. Existing lab replicates t_repl only so cannot use its goodlag to prove other tables covered.\n3 Both products require HAowner authoritative role\/topology\/routing epoch\/collection age\/event source and applicable approval. Include concrete read-only MySQL observation path e.g existing HA topologyexport and server UUID\/read_only\/super_read_only + SHOW REPLICA STATUS channel\/source UUID, GR member role\/state only for actual GR; neither readonly flag nor channel existence alone authoritative role. No auto grants\/globalinstrument\/config changes. SQL existing AG local role\/is_primary_replica via existing DMVs\/HAcollector, intendedlistener\/actualserver\/DB routing checks. No bare ApplicationIntent=ReadOnly guarantee. On promotion\/role\/routing\/epoch change or stale\/unavailable\/unknown role, qualification EXPIRES: stop new work, cancel currently owned query through existing verified identity\/finally\/rollback\/release\/recovery path, results HOLD pending approval, requalify identity+role+dataequivalence+resources+freshness before resume. Never blind reconnect\/retry; new physical session after driver\/proxy retries requires freshgate. Pin actualbackend\/lease or HOLD if cannot observe. Promotion candidate must integrate HAowner procedure\/events with stop gate and cancellation\/release acknowledgment BEFORE promotion accepts service workload where required; no synchronization possible => use independent restored copy. Polling only narrows detection delay; not race-free prevention. Don't require COUNT to prevent essential failover: HApriority, unknown termination=>incident escalation\/no newCOUNT, no safe-primary guarantee. No automatic failover experiment necessary; unverified integration => HOLD. All newsemantics must cite primary officialdocs, do not copy long quotes. Current receipt may be absent until owner and two Sol reviewers complete, allowed pending link. Return JSON status,files,unresolvedIssues; no acceptance assertion.\n\nExact inputs: {\"documents\": {\"README.md\": \"823ef857270dc21710214834dc65a18adc1ce23e32